      <!-- RESEARCH BEHIND THE DESIGN -->
      <h2>What I tested before recommending it</h2>
      <p>The tests checked whether a query retrieved a rule together with its qualification, as well as whether parsing preserved the document’s structure. Keeping the input fixed made the checks repeatable after each repair. I also compared multi-page OCR, image-based retrieval, and three ways of representing flowcharts. The findings below explain what those alternatives preserved and where further processing was needed.</p>
